    "title": "Ladakh elevates hospitality to 'industry' status: What this means for your next Himalayan adventure | Travel",
    "text": "Cheaper stays and better facilities?\nAs per news agencies PTI and ANI, there are 1,257 registered hotels and guesthouses across Leh and Kargil – and the core of this reform lies in slashing overhead costs for these. By moving these establishments from 'commercial' to 'industrial' categories, the administration is passing on significant savings to business owners:",
